{
  "name": "45 · News Digest (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 45 · News Digest\nEvery morning: your industry's news from the last 24 hours → AI picks the **5 that matter to your business** and explains each in one line → sent on Telegram and WhatsApp. 2 minutes of reading instead of 30.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. In **Your feeds** replace YOUR+INDUSTRY and YOUR+CITY (use + for spaces) and describe your business in 'about'. Add any RSS feed, one per line.\n2. Telegram nodes: add a **Telegram API** credential (bot token from @BotFather) and replace YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.\n3. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup). Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format.\n4. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nDelete the Telegram or WhatsApp node if you only want one.",
        "height": 637,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "1ecb89cd-712f-49ac-b40a-4096862064e0",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 7,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b6f364b7-338d-46c3-b111-879ffe10f9f4",
      "name": "Daily 7 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e029a36b-c27c-403d-b571-20be856d956b",
              "name": "feeds",
              "value": "https://news.google.com/rss/search?q=YOUR+INDUSTRY+India&hl=en-IN&gl=IN&ceid=IN:en\nhttps://news.google.com/rss/search?q=YOUR+CITY+business&hl=en-IN&gl=IN&ceid=IN:en",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4d31c254-da3d-478a-b57e-656678d0dcb3",
              "name": "about",
              "value": "EDIT THIS: e.g. a bakery chain in Hyderabad that also sells online",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "747b77a1-2c01-47de-bec2-5b07fc7b27aa",
      "name": "Your feeds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return String($json.feeds).split('\\n').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean).map(url => ({ json: { url } }));"
      },
      "id": "8a0046de-eb05-486c-b526-fc5a1662f3ba",
      "name": "One item per feed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "ignoreSSL": false
        }
      },
      "id": "759ce0b2-92f6-48f7-be64-853a3d08b2bc",
      "name": "Read RSS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedRead",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const since = $now.minus({ hours: 24 });\nconst seen = new Set();\nconst items = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(n => n.title && DateTime.fromJSDate(new Date(n.isoDate || n.pubDate)) >= since)\n  .filter(n => { const k = n.title.toLowerCase().slice(0, 60); if (seen.has(k)) return false; seen.add(k); return true; })\n  .slice(0, 40).map(n => ({ title: n.title, link: n.link, source: n.creator || n.source || '' }));\nreturn items.length ? [{ json: { count: items.length, items, about: $('Your feeds').first().json.about } }] : [];"
      },
      "id": "efd6ff7b-c4e2-4bc0-b2e9-e2d83d3a2a7c",
      "name": "Last 24 hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You make a morning news digest for the owner of: {{ $json.about }}.\nToday's headlines (title, link): {{ JSON.stringify($json.items) }}\n\nPick the 5 most useful for this business (prices, rules, GST/government changes, competitors, demand, local events). Format: '📰 Morning digest' then 5 numbered items: one plain-English line on why it matters + the link on the next line. Use only these headlines; do not add facts that are not in the title. Output only the message.",
        "hasOutputParser": false
      },
      "id": "b1691f03-1d7a-4a5d-851d-51374913c3ec",
      "name": "AI picks top 5",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
